# Project Standards

- This is a multi-tenant Mobile Installment SaaS for Thailand (pilot).
- Merchants fund receivables; platform does not lend.
- Follow `docs/roadmap/CURRENT-PHASE.md` and do not skip phase gates.
- Prefer small increments; never scaffold the entire system in one change.
- Record architecture changes in `docs/project-management/DECISION-LOG.md`.
- External integrations use adapters; mark BLOCKED without credentials/hardware proof.
- No secrets in git. Use `.env.example` only.
- Decimal-safe money only. No float for currency.
- Tenant isolation and payment idempotency tests are mandatory for related work.
- Device restrictive actions require reason + authz; never from unverified webhooks.
- Emergency calling must remain available at all device levels.
- Do not claim Device Owner / MDM / live payments work without validation evidence.
- Treat R2 as a Device Provisioning & Enrollment Platform (DM0–DM5). Follow docs/project-management/MASTER-EXECUTION-PLAN.md.
- Enrollment tokens are short-lived; QR payloads contain no passwords or private keys; Play Protect disable is not a required step.
